{"nodes": [{"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_document", "label": "SponsorX Phase 1 Build Roadmap", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "Sequences Phase 1 for a two-person team; does not re-specify the how (that lives in Implementation Guide V2). Supersedes the 'greenfield, no code' baseline: a front-end prototype exists on fixtures, the backend is greenfield.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_block_a", "label": "Block A \u2014 Finish the UI Scaffold (Fixtures Only)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Everything renders on fixtures.ts / mock-auth.ts \u2014 no database, no auth, no network. Goal: a complete, on-brand, clickable demo of the entire \u00a739 loop on mock data, so Block B is pure substitution behind finished screens.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_block_b", "label": "Block B \u2014 Backend Spine (Swap Mock \u2192 Real)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "B0 foundations \u2192 B1 onboarding \u2192 B2 catalogue \u2192 B3 brief/invite \u2192 B4 Campaign Order \u2192 B5 deliverables \u2192 B6 funnels \u2192 B7 metrics/earnings/report \u2192 B8 Zoho + hardening + UAT. Each milestone follows the \u00a712 order \u2014 Zod contract \u2192 Prisma model \u2192 scope fn \u2192 domain fn \u2192 route handler \u2192 wire the existing UI \u2192 E2E test \u2014 and delivers one \u00a739 loop segment.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_a0_brand_retheme", "label": "A0 \u00b7 Brand Retheme", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Replace mockup-v1.0 purple/teal with the BTG logo's blue/orange via a token swap in globals.css \u2014 semantic tokens cascade through all ~25 routes; portal accents follow the logo; dark stays primary, light variant deferred to A2.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_a1_stub_routes", "label": "A1 \u00b7 Build the 10 Remaining Stub Routes", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Three loop-aligned batches (front door + athlete side, BTG operations, sponsor public + property); field-level rule enforced from fixtures onward \u2014 sponsor-facing screens never display AthleteRate.amount. Exit: no ScreenStub remains.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_a2_state_polish", "label": "A2 \u00b7 State & Polish Pass", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Loading/empty/error states for every screen, the light-theme variant, responsive phone-to-desktop, and the redeem page verified to render without JavaScript (\u00a716 \u2014 hit once, on venue wifi, on a phone).", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_a3_fixture_completeness", "label": "A3 \u00b7 Fixture Completeness", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Extend fixtures.ts so every screen's every state is representable (minor with unverified guardian, expired invite, under-delivering campaign, held earning), keeping every shape mirroring the V2 Prisma models so Block B stays a substitution.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_a_gates", "label": "A-Gates \u00b7 Resolve the Open Decisions", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Six written decisions run in parallel with A0\u2013A3 and block Block B, not Block A: payment policy (\u00a737 gate one), data residency, guardian e-signature, email provider, SMS deferral, counsel-approved Campaign Order and Content Collaboration Agreement templates.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_b0_foundations", "label": "B0 \u00b7 Foundations", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The heaviest milestone, unblocks everything: pins & deps, full Prisma schema + migrations + partial indexes, Railway web/worker/postgres project, Clerk replacing mock-auth with requireActor(), actor.ts + scope.ts + authz matrix green in CI, outbox + pg-boss, R2 two-bucket presign, contracts registry \u2192 openapi.json, seed job, lint rule failing bare findMany().", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "documentation_sponsorx_phase1_build_roadmap_ui_scaffold_first", "label": "UI-Scaffold-First Strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The prototype is \u00a712's step 6 (UI) built ahead on fixtures. Because the fixtures mirror the real V2 Prisma models, replacing them is a substitution, not a rewrite \u2014 which is exactly why finishing the UI scaffold before the backend is safe here.", "source_file": "documentation/SponsorX-Phase1-Build-Roadmap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "do